== Overview ==
The {{Celestial|Futuristic G-Man}} is a {{Celestial|[[Celestial]]}} unit that was added in the '''[[Futuristic Update]]'''. This unit has [[Sub-Traits|AoE]], [[Splash]] and [[Radioactive]] abilities.

== Appearance ==
The '''Futuristic G-Man''' is a unit of the [[Toilets (Units)|Toilets]] species. It resembles a G-Man covered in full-body armor, equipped with jetpacks on its back and two laser guns mounted on both shoulders, as well as one on its chest.

== Obtainment ==
You can obtain the '''Futuristic G-Man''' from the [[Shop]] with '''799 Robux''' price (Unobtainable), You can also get this unit through [[Trading]] with others, purchasing it with [[gems]] at the [[Marketplace]] or being gifted it by others in the [[Post Office]].

