== Strategy ==
• His AOE Range is too small so, Use a Range Booster Unit like [[Titan Swat Cameraman]] and/or give him a Trait that buffs his range.


== Trivia ==
*This unit is the first unit to have a cutscene upon being obtained.
*It will only reach 99 waves on Endless Mode if you placed only a single one.
*This unit looks very close to [[Boss Toilet 5.0]].
*This unit has 2 renders.

